# A loyalty ability is an activated ability (CR 606.1, 602.5), so naming a planeswalker with Sorcerous Spyglass bars it. Bot2 casts Narset,
# Parter of Veils on turn 2 and uses her -2 (the positive control: she works before the Spyglass); Bot1 casts the Spyglass on turn 3,
# looks at Bot2's hand and names Narset, and on turn 4 Bot2, whose Narset is untouched at three loyalty and has not activated this
# turn, is refused her ability (the refusal), though the Spyglass says nothing about her static ability.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Sorcerous Spyglass
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Narset, Parter of Veils
Island x3
Island x10

