Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Narset, Parter of Veils.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Narset, Parter of Veils.Activate(Ability: Look)
Bot2.Pass
